nsects to walk on water) and to other surfaces (adhesion—which helps water move up the roots of giant trees against gravity).\n\n### 3. Water on Earth\n*   **The Blue Planet:** About **71% of Earth's surface** is covered in water, mostly by oceans.\n*   **Scarcity:** Of all the water on"
